{"id": "marin-street-water-headquarters-design", "title": "An arts commissioner voted on a water project while his firm sought the design work", "seconds": 65.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "2c59bf6d2f3a12de", "words": 151, "beats": [{"scene": "b", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An arts commissioner voted on a design his firm hoped to help deliver.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.23, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "reviewed", "the", "design?"], "sub": "2000 Marin water headquarters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 1.14, 1.46, 1.57, 1.65, 2.22, 2.45, 2.84, 3.1, 3.2, 3.46]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The bid listed his studio for about two point seven million dollars.", "t0": 4.35, "t1": 8.75, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.7 million", "label": "Proposed subcontract labor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 0.9, 1.06, 1.62, 1.8, 2.1, 2.51, 2.9, 3.34, 3.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A different architect had initially ranked first in the bidding.", "t0": 8.87, "t1": 11.91, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-review3", "kicker": "December 20 selection", "text": "KMD Architects", "mark": "KMD"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 1.05, 1.25, 1.74, 2.04, 2.43, 2.54, 2.64]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Two teams lost eligibility over their overhead and profit forms.", "t0": 12.03, "t1": 15.57, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-review2", "kicker": "Second solicitation", "text": "Labor rate multiplier", "mark": "multiplier"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.65, 1.01, 1.69, 1.87, 2.04, 2.48, 2.62, 3.03]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The utilities commission approved the remaining team. Supervisors held the contract.", "t0": 15.79, "t1": 21.07, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-determination", "kicker": "May committee review", "text": "Board approval", "mark": "approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.74, 1.14, 1.71, 1.85, 2.29, 3.38, 4.27, 4.53, 4.64]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The commissioner resigned. The utilities commission later withdrew the award.", "t0": 21.19, "t1": 26.14, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-rescission", "kicker": "September 14 solicitation", "text": "Rescinded award", "mark": "award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.87, 2.1, 2.32, 2.97, 3.45, 3.75, 4.29, 4.44]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Two firms competed in a third round under revised requirements.", "t0": 26.26, "t1": 30.36, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "883.1", "label": "Highest technical and interview score"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.85, 1.43, 1.56, 1.64, 1.96, 2.47, 2.76, 3.35]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "KMD returned. Supervisors approved the agreement with Cavagnero.", "t0": 30.48, "t1": 34.87, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$27.8 million", "label": "Third solicitation ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 1.7, 2.5, 2.93, 3.04, 3.47, 3.64]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The architect’s lobbyist reported seeking support from three supervisors before the vote.", "t0": 34.99, "t1": 40.13, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-lobby-contacts", "kicker": "February 2023 disclosures", "text": "Three contacts seeking support", "mark": "support"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.73, 1.34, 1.84, 2.27, 3.08, 3.3, 3.58, 4.34, 4.67, 4.78]}, {"scene": "e", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The signed ethics order separated the subcontract from the design vote.", "t0": 40.35, "t1": 45.35, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-determination", "kicker": "May 2023 order", "text": "Financial conflict of interest", "mark": "interest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.77, 1.23, 1.63, 2.27, 2.4, 3.72, 3.96, 4.09, 4.6]}, {"scene": "e", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The first carried a $2,000 penalty. The vote drew $5,000.", "t0": 45.47, "t1": 51.82, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,000", "label": "Penalty for the design vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 1.06, 1.42, 1.52, 1.86, 2.37, 2.79, 3.91, 4.12, 4.69, 5.02, 5.35, 5.81]}, {"scene": "e", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The final design contract excluded the former commissioner’s firm.", "t0": 51.94, "t1": 55.87, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-determination", "kicker": "Final design contract", "text": "Excluded as a subcontractor", "mark": "subcontractor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.59, 1.16, 1.83, 2.51, 2.62, 2.94, 3.52]}, {"scene": "e", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The commission credited his cooperation and found no evidence of intentional deception.", "t0": 55.99, "t1": 61.31, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marin-determination", "kicker": "Ethics commission", "text": "Cooperated with the investigation", "mark": "Cooperated"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.63, 1.17, 1.35, 2.43, 2.79, 3.16, 3.47, 3.99, 4.14, 4.7]}, {"scene": "e", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.43, "t1": 64.06, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"b": "The proposal and the vote", "v": "The rescission and new competition", "e": "The signed order"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "timeline"}